{"unit_id":"seriousz158__dsh-memory#card-zh","repo":"seriousz158/dsh-memory","commit":"f7b03757f8bf546d3c007f8e9a074a847b681d3d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的本地长期记忆插件。它把 Git 管理的记忆接入系统提示词和只读工具，并在设置页提供开关、状态查看、同步预览与回滚、旧记录迁移及二次确认清理。memory_search 支持按关键词检索并返回引用，memory_context 可读取有界记录；启用后会注入受长度限制的 summary.md。记忆保存在本机仓库，不需 API Key 或云端记忆服务；可配置 DSH_HOME、DSH_MEMORY_ROOT。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-git-memory/lib/index.js:1604"]}
{"unit_id":"seriousz158__dsh-memory#card-en","repo":"seriousz158/dsh-memory","commit":"f7b03757f8bf546d3c007f8e9a074a847b681d3d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory adds Git-backed local memory to DSH. It injects a bounded summary into prompts and offers read-only search and context tools with citations. Its settings page shows repository status and manages sync previews, rollback, legacy migration, and confirmed clearing. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-git-memory/lib/index.js:1604"]}
