{"unit_id":"seriousz158__dsh-memory#caveat-1","repo":"seriousz158/dsh-memory","commit":"f7b03757f8bf546d3c007f8e9a074a847b681d3d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 使用前须知：记忆目录是本机 Git 仓库；DSH_HOME 默认 ~/.dsh，记忆根目录默认位于其中的 storages/memory，也可通过 DSH_MEMORY_ROOT 指定。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-git-memory/lib/index.js:37"]}
{"unit_id":"seriousz158__dsh-memory#caveat-2","repo":"seriousz158/dsh-memory","commit":"f7b03757f8bf546d3c007f8e9a074a847b681d3d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 使用前须知：设置页清理会建立可恢复的 Git 状态；这属于日常恢复能力，不能保证从 Git 历史中安全擦除内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-git-memory/lib/index.js:1410"]}
{"unit_id":"seriousz158__dsh-memory#caveat-3","repo":"seriousz158/dsh-memory","commit":"f7b03757f8bf546d3c007f8e9a074a847b681d3d","type":"caveat","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory stores memory in a local Git repository; DSH_HOME and DSH_MEMORY_ROOT select its location.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-git-memory/lib/index.js:37"]}
